 (name "TRIMMER-THT-6X6-MEASURED")
 (description "Horizontal blue/white trimmer, custom footprint from user measurements. Two pins spaced 6.0 mm; isolated pin offset 6.0 mm from their line. Pad positions viewed from PCB component side, mirrored from underside photographs. Pads 1 and 3 are the paired terminals; isolated pad 2 is the wiper. User confirmed package fit and wiper identity on 2026-10-27. CW/CCW direction remains unverified. Body documentation is approximate 6.4 x 7.0 mm. Drill 1.2 mm, copper pads 2.4 mm.")
